== Overview ==
The '''Glasses Toilet''' is a normal-sized [[Enemies|toilet]] which is slower than normal but has more health, and has glasses which makes it immune to most types of [[TVs]]. It has a [[Large Glass Toilet|large]] and [[Giant Glass Toilet|giant]] variant like most other normal-sized toilets. 
== Appearance ==
The Glasses Toilet looks much like a normal [[Toilet]] but with a gray colored bowl and cistern. It has shades on its eyes to protect itself from [[TVs]].   
