== Strategy ==
* In most modes, '''Glasses Toilet''' does not appear until midgame, and usually at that time, you have multiple types of units down, so you do not have to worry. However, in [[Nightmare Mode]], Glasses Toilet appears very early on with a lot of HP, and also does 100 damage to the base. Do not use any types of TV units other than Spider TV for Nightmare Mode early game.

== Trivia ==
*This toilet can be affected by [[Large TV Man]] and [[TV Man]] if used in the start of the map.
*Most TV men cannot attack this enemy, even though it is shown they can in the series. [[TV Woman]], [[Spider TV]], and [[Titan Cinemaman]], and [[Upgraded Titan Cinemaman]] can attack this enemy.
*It is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Glass_Skibidi_Toilet?so=search Glasses Skibidi Toilet] from the series.
*The Glasses are based on [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/11748356/Clockworks-Shades Clockwork's Shades] (Roblox Face Accessory)

